# Cited paths that are legitimately not in this repository, so the knowledge-catalog
# validator should not report them as rotted citations. One regex per line.
#
# Only add a pattern when the path genuinely lives somewhere else. A file that used to
# be in the repo and was deleted or renamed does NOT belong here - fix the citation.

# On-device paths, named when documenting adb inspection of app storage.
^shared_prefs/
_prefs\.xml$
^user_settings\.xml$

# Android framework and vendor-ROM resources, named to explain styling and MIUI quirks.
^abc_[a-z_]+\.xml$
^theme_compatibility\.xml$
